    {
      "cn_text": "追溯这一术语的历史，我们可以看到科学素养的定义如何随时间推移而变化，这使得确定科学教育目标变得愈发模糊。",
      "en_text": "Tracing the history of the term, we can see how the definition of scientific literacy has shifted over time, muddying the waters when it comes to determining the goals of science education.",
