    {
      "cn_text": "这令人遗憾，因为科学素养这一理念在1945年最初提出时确有许多可取之处，彼时科学似乎是进步的关键，科学家似乎将世界的命运掌握在手中。",
      "en_text": "And that’s a shame, because there is much to recommend in the idea of scientific literacy as it was originally articulated in 1945, a time when science appeared to be the key to progress and scientists seemingly held the fate of the world in their hands.",
